cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use latenzy, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "latenzy: per-model LLM latency monitoring"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Patole
    given-names: Amit
    email: amit.patole@gmail.com
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-08-04
repository-code: "https://github.com/amitpatole/latenzy"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  A synthetic prober and Prometheus exporter with prebuilt Grafana dashboards
  that measures per-model LLM latency (time-to-first-token, total latency,
  streaming throughput, rate-limit pressure) across Claude, OpenAI, and Gemini
  models, at model-ID granularity rather than lab-level rollups.
